 style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\">Who it affects:<\/span><\/b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> Golfers, baseball pitchers, rock climbers, weightlifters, manual laborers with repetitive gripping.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\">Treatment approach:<\/span><\/b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> Similar to tennis elbow\u2014rest, physical therapy, bracing, injections; surgery if needed after exhausting conservative options.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\">Recovery timeline:<\/span><\/b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"> 6-12 months conservative; 3-6 months post-surgery.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a8609cd elementor-widget__width-initial e-transform elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-jkit_button\" data-id=\"a8609cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:5,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:500,&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateX_effect_hover_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;_transform_translateY_effect_hover&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&q